{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d5e7","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0ae0f-ee07-7b81-b4d4-cf94ccb5debd"},"sequence":2382,"recorded_at":1780531400004759,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"b7392d99-bbd5-4114-ba32-61509405cfc4","payload_type":"run.terminal.completed","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"run_terminal","command_id":"b7392d99-bbd5-4114-ba32-61509405cfc4","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"b7392d99-bbd5-4114-ba32-61509405cfc4"},"terminal":"completed","text":"Verdict: **accepted** — CR-TASK-260830-3g12yp-1 (rev 1) is accepted and TASK-260830-3g12yp is routed to `integrating`. No product edits were made; the candidate stays uncommitted in the Story worktree.\n\nWhat I verified with my own instruments (isolated copies only, live tree never mutated):\n\n- **Spec fidelity**: quoted the pinned clauses (2.2 lines 408–413, §4 wrapper 1366–1372, 5.3 tuple rule 1954–1970, LeaseToken line 2952, park vocabulary line 1799, §15.2 exits) and diffed them against `internal/fencing/gate.go` / `terminate.go` / `token.go`. Refusal exits 10/10/10/2/3 reproduced via `TestGateRefusalsUseRegisteredCodes`; no new class minted.\n- **Coverage**: 18/18 AC rows driven through production entries (0/18 CLI by stated bound); 28/28 refusal/park arms named-tested.\n- **Attacks**: swap of adjacent arms, one-token class swallow, and park-branch deletion all go RED on the existing suite. Own narrowings M2/M3/M4 killed; T-census-alias rerun killed with the full 264-test suite executing. Tie-break divergences killed on both comparator sides. Two SURVIVED cases analyzed: M1 masked by defense-in-depth (same class), M1f reveals only an undriven `{epoch 0, valid third lease}` vector — filed as P3, not a gate hole.\n- **Agreement**: 144-pair enumeration confirmed; `created_at` provably a member of neither comparator.\n- **Traceability**: `tracecheck` rerun → 110/57/28/485 exactly as claimed; all 28 clause lines resolve verbatim; predecessor P2 items (5.3 rebind + digest re-pin, 144-pair extension) discharged.\n- **Gates**: fencing 40/40; sessrepo/sessquery/sessstate/traceability suites green; `-race` green on all five (sessquery 485s); vet, gofmt, `cataloggen -check`, `git diff --check`, full + Windows builds clean. Changed paths exactly the 22 CR paths.\n\nAttached: `TASK-260830-3g12yp_review-verdict-rev1.md` (verdict) and `TASK-260830-3g12yp_review-evidence-rev1.tar.gz` (per-plant raw logs, valid gzip). Two P3 advisories recorded in the verdict (extra malformed-presented vector; stale §17.2 prose). Integration is the orchestrator's step via the bound `developer`/`implementer` run.","reason":null}}
